This picture is based off my desired wants of an aircraft that resembled the Cirrus Sr 20. An example that was chosen is
close to the wing loading of a Cirrus SR 20 and my T/W is exceptional for an aircraft. The results from personal calculation
I ended up with the wing area reference being 8.2 m^2, the mass during takeoff after burning 1 gallon of fuel is 865.84 kg, 
and the required thrust for this design is 1596.85 newton. If my aircraft inputs are not available to be shown from the 
user_TW_aircraft.mat in the src folder then here is what I used:
